# A segment's values typed fast over the canvas, before the field has the
# keyboard: the length 12, its 2 on the frame the field takes the keyboard
# and Enter on the next, when ImGui's field does not route it yet; then the
# angle 90, Enter on the frame after its seed, which completes the shape
# with both values as typed.
open docs/instances/sketch-basic.json
wait 16
action tool.segment
wait 2
click L 724 291
wait 2
move 800 250 3
wait 2
text "1"
wait 1
text "2"
key Enter
wait 4
text "90"
key Enter
wait 4
